{"3300510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bricks Over Blocks", "steam_appid": 3300510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A delightful game in the classic <strong>brick breaker</strong> genre. Defend blocks in immersive 3D environments, skillfully dodge hazards, and strategically break through bricks to progress. With a fresh twist on familiar gameplay, each level presents new challenges, dynamic obstacles, and powerful upgrades to help you conquer every brick-filled stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring vibrant 3D visuals, smooth controls, and engaging mechanics, <strong>Bricks Over Blocks</strong> delivers a modern take on the brick-breaking experience. Whether you’re chasing high scores or trying to keep your head above lava, this game will keep you engaged with its dynamic gameplay and escalating difficulty. Do you have what it takes to smash through the bricks and complete the challenge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D platforming</strong> combined with classic <strong>brick-breaking mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging levels with a variety of hazards and power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful <strong>3D environments</strong> and engaging sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth controls</strong> and responsive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with increasing difficulty to keep you hooked</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your brick-breaking adventure in <strong>Bricks Over Blocks</strong> today!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A delightful game in the classic <strong>brick breaker</strong> genre. Defend blocks in immersive 3D environments, skillfully dodge hazards, and strategically break through bricks to progress. With a fresh twist on familiar gameplay, each level p